### 🅴️ 5.6 DeepSeek — Open-Weight, Mixture-of-Experts

```
DeepSeek V4 Pro:   1.6T total params, ~49B ACTIVE per token
DeepSeek V4 Flash: 284B total params, ~13B ACTIVE per token
```

**Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) concept:**
```
Huge total model → only SELECTED experts activate per token
                 → smaller active compute than the "total size" suggests
```

Demonstrates: you don't always need the most expensive closed model — an efficient model + a strong harness can rival pricier options.

