### ⚙️ 5.10 What "Power" Actually Means (6 Different Axes)

```
1. Raw reasoning     — math, logic, novel problems
2. Coding ability    — generation, debugging, navigation
3. Agentic ability   — tool use, planning, recovery
4. Context capacity  — how much info it can process
5. Speed             — tokens/sec, latency
6. Cost efficiency   — verified work ÷ (money + tokens + time)
```

There is no single "most powerful" model — only the best fit for a given axis and task.

