### 🏆 5.11 Practical Tiering for Coding & Agentic Work

```
TIER S — Hardest autonomous engineering
  Claude Fable 5 / Mythos 5, GPT-5.6 Sol, Claude Opus 5, Gemini frontier tiers
  → complex repos, hard architecture/debugging, high-consequence work

TIER A — Best everyday professional coding (the "sweet spot")
  Claude Sonnet 5, GPT-5.6 Terra, Gemini 3.7 Flash, Grok 4.6, DeepSeek V4 Flash

TIER B — High-volume / cost-efficient
  GPT-5.6 Luna, Claude Haiku 4.5, Gemini Flash tiers, DeepSeek V4 Flash, Qwen efficient models
```

**Important nuance:** a *more capable* model can sometimes use **fewer total tokens** — because a weak model failing 4 times (1M+ tokens across retries) can cost more than a strong model succeeding once (~200K tokens). Optimize for **cost per verified successful task**, not cost per million tokens.

